## Shared Commands

- `:ALL`: load shared state and report before acting.
- `:ONE`: select one owner. Fuzzy input is allowed, but the agent must normalize it into goal, owner, scope, risk, and next action before editing.
- `:CHECK`: compare local rules, skills, memory, and project rules against GitHub truth. Read-only by default; append coordination result when safe.

